General => General

framerate => Limits game updates per second.
scriptUpdateFrameLimit => Off follows game updates. On follows actual drawn frames.
scriptUpdateRate => 0 follows the selected update mode. Higher values cap script updates per second.
drawFramerate => Applies with independent rendering.
language => Change engine language
lockRender => When off, drawing follows updates.
renderThread => Separating the rendering thread improves frame rates
vsync => Synchronizes rendering with the display refresh.
generationalGC => Applies at the next launch.
androidPerformanceHints => Report frame timing to Android.
lowQuality => Turn off some object on stages
resolution => The resolution of the game graphics
colorblindMode => Colorblind filter more playable for colorblind people
antialiasing => Toggle antialiasing, improving graphics quality at a slight performance penalty
flashing => Toggle flashing lights that can cause epileptic seizures and strain
shaders => Shaders used for some visual effects
autoShaderConversion => Automatically converts desktop OpenFL shaders to the OpenGL ES version supported by this mobile device
mouseTrailEffect => Enables pointer trails and click effects; both are hidden automatically in PlayState
cacheOnGPU => Allows the GPU to be used for caching textures, decreasing RAM usage
autoPause => Stops game, when its unfocused
replayQuality => Records per-note hit data for more accurate replays. Uses more memory and disk space.
gcFreeZone => Suspend most of the RAM cleaning to reduce sudden lag during gameplay and solve the problem of memory leakage crashes caused by excessive RAM usage.
